      "message": "This is not belong to a different change. The purpose of this vh function is that hope the reserved field would not be cleared by memset statement after vh function.\n\nIn order to tell v4l2-framework that vh function is exist and has been register, it must return a non-zero value.\n\nBut for v4l2_subdev_call\n\n  return 0, means success\n  return \u003c 0, means fail\nso, we must let vh function return 1 if success, and return \u003c 0 if fail.\nBut finally, the return value must be changed back to 0 if success.\n\nso I add this statement \"return (ret \u003e 0) ? 0 : ret\"",
